## Nginx Configuration (VPS Action)

You will need to manually add this block to your Nginx configuration on the VPS:

```nginx
location /uploads/ {
    alias /var/www/uploads/;
    
    # Enable CORS if frontend and backend are on different domains
    add_header Access-Control-Allow-Origin *;
    
    # Cache optimization
    expires 30d;
    add_header Cache-Control "public, max-age=2592000";
    
    # Disable logging to save disk I/O
    access_log off;
}
```
**Permissions Note:** The Node.js process (PM2) must have `write` access to `/var/www/uploads/`, and the Nginx user (`www-data` or `nginx`) must have `read` access.

