## Verification & Testing Plan

Once executed, the following testing checklist will guarantee system stability:

### 1. Uploads
- [ ] Upload an image via the admin panel/app. Verify it processes without errors.
- [ ] Verify the returned URL is an absolute local URL (`https://.../uploads/...`).
- [ ] Verify the file is physically present in the VPS `UPLOAD_PATH` directory.
- [ ] Upload a PDF and a Video to verify non-image handling.

### 2. Frontend Rendering
- [ ] Verify newly uploaded local images render correctly in the browser.
- [ ] Verify old Cloudinary images continue to render correctly with their optimization parameters.

### 3. Deletion & Replacement
- [ ] Update an entity holding a **Cloudinary** image with a new image. Verify the old Cloudinary image is deleted from the Cloudinary dashboard, and the new image is local.
- [ ] Update an entity holding a **Local** image with another new image. Verify the old local file is removed from the VPS disk.

### 4. Infrastructure
- [ ] Restart PM2 (`pm2 restart all`) and ensure no startup errors.
- [ ] Restart Nginx (`systemctl restart nginx`) and ensure images load.

