## Rollback Plan
If any critical issues arise, rolling back is completely non-destructive:
1. Revert `Backend/src/modules/uploads/routes/upload.routes.js` to point back to `cloudinary.service.js`.
2. Any local URLs saved during the test period will **still work** because Nginx will continue serving them, while new uploads will revert to Cloudinary. No database rollback is required.
